	<div class="reports">
<div class="banner"><img src="/images/websites/tta/data/usdata.webp?version=900451CB" alt="U.S. Data" style="" />
<div class="container">
<h1 class="title">U.S. Sales Data</h1>
</div>
</div>
<div class="reports__opport">
<div class="container">
<p>U.S. market size for the total toy industry for 2025, projected to 100% of the market, was approximately $45.6 billion, according to Circana Checkout.*</p>
<p>U.S. retail sales of toys generated $30.3 billion in 2025 and grew by +6% vs. last year according to Circana’s U.S. Retail Tracking Services that covers 68% of the U.S. Toys Market.**   While retail toy sales grew 6% from 2024 to 2025, the total dollar value of the industry has remained relatively flat compared with 2021.***</p>
<p>U.S. toy industry dollar volume and trends by Super Category shows that Games/Puzzles has emerged as the largest toy category, generating $4.9 billion in 2025.****</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div></div>
